Driver MySQL ditambahkan di `pom.xml`:

```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>com.mysql</groupId>
  <artifactId>mysql-connector-j</artifactId>
  <version>9.1.0</version>
</dependency>
```

URL dan sandi:

```java
String url = "jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/todolist";
String sandi = System.getenv("DB_PASSWORD");
Connection koneksi = DriverManager.getConnection(url, "root", sandi);
```

Sandi dibaca dari **environment variable**, bukan ditulis di kode. Di terminal Linux/macOS diatur dengan `export DB_PASSWORD=...`, di Windows PowerShell dengan `$env:DB_PASSWORD="..."`. Kode bisa di-commit ke GitHub tanpa membocorkan sandi.

**HikariCP** adalah connection pool paling populer di Java (bawaan Spring Boot):

```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>com.zaxxer</groupId>
  <artifactId>HikariCP</artifactId>
  <version>6.2.1</version>
</dependency>
```

```java
HikariConfig config = new HikariConfig();
config.setJdbcUrl("jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/todolist");
config.setUsername("root");
config.setPassword(System.getenv("DB_PASSWORD"));
config.setMaximumPoolSize(10);
try (HikariDataSource ds = new HikariDataSource(config)) {
    try (Connection c = ds.getConnection()) {   // pinjam dari pool
        ...
    }                                          // close() = kembalikan ke pool
}
```

`HikariDataSource` adalah `DataSource`: antarmuka standar Java untuk "sumber koneksi". Kode repository cukup menerima `DataSource`, tanpa tahu koneksinya dari pool atau bukan.

langkah.keluaran:
package com.bisangoding.todolist;

import java.sql.Connection;
import java.sql.DriverManager;
import java.sql.ResultSet;
import java.sql.SQLException;
import java.sql.Statement;

public class App {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws SQLException {
        String url = "jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/todolist";
        String sandi = System.getenv("DB_PASSWORD");
        try (Connection koneksi = DriverManager.getConnection(url, "root", sandi);
             Statement st = koneksi.createStatement();
             ResultSet rs = st.executeQuery("SELECT id, judul, selesai FROM todo ORDER BY id")) {
            System.out.println("Terhubung ke " + koneksi.getMetaData().getDatabaseProductName() + " "
                    + koneksi.getMetaData().getDatabaseProductVersion());
            while (rs.next()) {
                System.out.println(rs.getInt("id") + ". [" + (rs.getBoolean("selesai") ? "x" : " ") + "] " + rs.getString("judul"));
            }
        }
    }
}
